  "_comment": "ADR-0562 §10.25 move-21: home the `billing` capability (metering + billing + tax + finops/cost + accounting). SIXTEEN crates from FOUR source dirs (cloud/cloud-billing/crates, cloud/cloud-billing-tax/crates, cloud/cloud-finops/crates, oya/accounting/crates) across FOUR faces (core 7 / ports 3 / adapters 2 / facade 4). billing is the first-class cross-cutting sold-ness capability (NOT a junk-drawer). FACE DECISIONS verified by ACTUAL deps: (1) oya-cloud-billing-tax-app -> ports/tax-api because it is a lib-only crate (crate_root=src/lib.rs, NO [[bin]]/main.rs) with an EMPTY [dependencies] (no adapter wiring) — an API/contract surface, not a deployable; (2) oya-accounting-journal-app -> core/accounting-app because it is lib-only (no bin) and its only deps are libs/oya-data-boundary-kernel (base-class lib) + oya-accounting-journal-domain (sibling core) — pure orchestration/usecase logic with NO adapter dependency, so core/ holds (it is NOT a composition root). cargo == de-branded path-tail `billing-<leaf>` (face dir NOT in the name; the legacy oya-cloud-billing-/oya-cloud-finops-/oya-accounting-journal- forms drop to the billing- slug; the role suffix is dropped where the face implies it and the source-dir cell discriminator is dropped since leaves stay distinct). artifacts co-move the 12 promotion-gating SLOs into per-service subdirs billing/observability/slos/{cloud-billing,cloud-billing-tax}/ (collision-avoiding for the shared autosharding-events.openslo.yaml basename across cloud-billing + cloud-billing-tax) and re-key the 16 pre-existing registry/catalog records oya-* -> billing-* (all 16 moved crates carry exactly one gate-bound registry/catalog record). justification_ref: ADR-0562 §10.25; reachability seed: billing/OWNERS (specs/reachability-registry.json §10.25). Violation-source: billing's outbound edges (billing/finops domains -> cell-region/compute-resource; saas-bench -> workflow-saas-*/marketplace-plugin-kernel/oya-saas-plugin-app) relabel old->new via the ADR-0563 rename-aware engine; zero NEW violations. The oya/accounting/catalog/ product-catalog records + cloud-billing/cloud-billing-tax/cloud-finops manifest.json/docs/PRD/IPs/contracts/iac are non-crate artifacts homed in phase-2 (task #62), per the §10.5..§10.24 precedent.",
